  "scope_notes": "Modifies the experimental libbitcoinkernel C API and its C++ wrapper.",
  "changed_since_previous": "The core approach and interface changes remain unchanged.",
  "card": "Restricts libbitcoinkernel to allow only one active logging connection per process at a time. Because the underlying kernel logger is a process-wide singleton, permitting multiple connections gave library consumers the false impression that independent loggers could be configured. Attempting to create a second connection now fails, the constructor is renamed to btck_global_logging_connection_create, and log level configuration is moved to the connection handle.",
